 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idp94745920\" class=\"interactive\" data-label=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<h4 data-type=\"title\" id=\"5\" class=\"os-subtitle\">\n  <span class=\"os-subtitle-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h4>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idm63607088\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20220801.182716/resources/3f276f0e9c092ebcd967cec8a1efa3cd870e0209\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" id=\"6\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-idp182915872\">Play this <a href=\"https://openstaxcollege.org/l/mating_game\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">interactive PBS evolution-based mating game</a> to learn more about reproductive strategies.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
